    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Deux fr\u00e8res, voleurs et experts en v\u00e9hicules rares et de collection, jettent leur d\u00e9volu sur une Bugatti 1937, joyau r\u00e9cemment acquis par un homme puissant et dangereux du Sud de la France. D\u00e9masqu\u00e9s par ce dernier, les deux fr\u00e8res n\u2019ont d\u2019autre choix que d\u2019accepter d\u2019aider ce mafieux \u00e0 d\u00e9rober ce qu\u2019il lui manque: La Ferrari 62 de son pire ennemi, qui veut s\u2019implanter \u00e0 Marseille. Mais jouer le jeu n\u2019est-ce pas une mani\u00e8re de re-distribuer les cartes et de jouer son propre jeu?",
        "english": "Two brothers, thieves and experts in rare and collectible cars, aim to steal a Bugatti 1937, a jewel recently acquired by a powerful and dangerous man from the South of France. Unmasked by the latter, the two brothers have no other choice than to accept to help this gangster to steal what he's missing: the Ferrari 62 of his worst enemy, who wants to set up shop in Marseille. But isn't playing the game a way of handing out the cards in a different way and ensuring that you've got the winning hand?"
